<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1887056126"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1891333859"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Toy Doll"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="内田秀"/><amll:meta key="album" value="L！L！L！ (Love the Life We Live)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:01.749"><div begin="00:00.855" end="04:02.089"><p begin="00:00.855" end="00:03.633" itunes:key="L1">Here we go, we go, we gotta go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以下歌词翻译由文曲大模型提供</span></p><p begin="00:03.643" end="00:06.265" itunes:key="L2">'Cause I know, I know that miracles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我深知奇迹终会降临</span></p><p begin="00:06.475" end="00:09.098" itunes:key="L3">Really do come true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美梦定能成真</span></p><p begin="00:09.108" end="00:11.146" itunes:key="L4">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="00:11.156" end="00:13.372" itunes:key="L5">Three, two, one, let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="00:23.864" end="00:26.504" itunes:key="L6">Come again? Tell me when you will understand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请再说一次</span></p><p begin="00:26.514" end="00:30.469" itunes:key="L7">Don't pretend 'cause you're turning red again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别假装</span></p><p begin="00:30.707" end="00:32.755" itunes:key="L8">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="00:34.717" end="00:37.417" itunes:key="L9">It's okay, I don't hate having company<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系</span></p><p begin="00:37.462" end="00:41.607" itunes:key="L10">We can call this date now, don't you think?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻就称它为约会吧</span></p><p begin="00:41.735" end="00:44.103" itunes:key="L11">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="00:44.910" end="00:47.591" itunes:key="L12">I know you like how I treat you like a toy doll<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知你爱我把你当作玩偶般宠溺</span></p><p begin="00:47.601" end="00:50.393" itunes:key="L13">Play you around till you're begging that you want it all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逗弄你直到你娇嗔着渴求更多</span></p><p begin="00:50.403" end="00:53.256" itunes:key="L14">Why don't we try going to a different level<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要占有全部</span></p><p begin="00:53.566" end="00:55.371" itunes:key="L15">Wanna play "house" with me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想与我共筑爱巢吗</span></p><p begin="00:55.642" end="00:58.350" itunes:key="L16">Here we go, we go, we gotta go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发 必须即刻启程</span></p><p begin="00:58.360" end="01:01.322" itunes:key="L17">'Cause I know, I know that miracles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我深知奇迹终会降临</span></p><p begin="01:01.332" end="01:04.077" itunes:key="L18">Really do come true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美梦定能成真</span></p><p begin="01:04.087" end="01:05.949" itunes:key="L19">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="01:06.006" end="01:06.685" itunes:key="L20">Let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="01:06.733" end="01:09.469" itunes:key="L21">You and me, a team, how brilliant!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发吧</span></p><p begin="01:09.517" end="01:12.163" itunes:key="L22">Now you'll see how sweet I really am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在你将见识我真正的甜蜜</span></p><p begin="01:12.173" end="01:14.977" itunes:key="L23">Don't you fall for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可别为我神魂颠倒</span></p><p begin="01:15.040" end="01:16.890" itunes:key="L24">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="01:16.920" end="01:19.206" itunes:key="L25">Three, two, one, let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="01:21.422" end="01:24.150" itunes:key="L26">I don't know why you're so crazy into me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何你对我如此着迷</span></p><p begin="01:24.160" end="01:28.352" itunes:key="L27">Wanting more than before it's plain to see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望更多 心意显而易见</span></p><p begin="01:28.369" end="01:30.424" itunes:key="L28">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="01:32.453" end="01:35.139" itunes:key="L29">Won't deny, I kinda like playing hard to get<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不否认</span></p><p begin="01:35.149" end="01:39.291" itunes:key="L30">Take your time, but you're mine so don't forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慢慢来别着急</span></p><p begin="01:39.300" end="01:41.607" itunes:key="L31">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="01:42.387" end="01:45.359" itunes:key="L32">I've been a good girl it's time for you to pay up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直很乖很听话</span></p><p begin="01:45.369" end="01:47.837" itunes:key="L33">And if you could baby no complaining, please shut up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝可别抱怨连连</span></p><p begin="01:47.947" end="01:50.946" itunes:key="L34">I caught you looking so I deserve this back rub<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请安静别说话</span></p><p begin="01:50.956" end="01:53.358" itunes:key="L35">A little lower, oh! Right there!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再往下些 对就是那里</span></p><p begin="01:53.370" end="01:56.130" itunes:key="L36">Here we go, we go, we gotta go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发 必须即刻启程</span></p><p begin="01:56.140" end="01:58.992" itunes:key="L37">We are young and wild and powerful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们年轻狂野且势不可挡</span></p><p begin="01:59.002" end="02:01.622" itunes:key="L38">Ready to explore<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好探索这世界</span></p><p begin="02:01.632" end="02:03.661" itunes:key="L39">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="02:03.671" end="02:04.318" itunes:key="L40">Let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="02:04.328" end="02:07.093" itunes:key="L41">You and me can be unstoppable<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发吧</span></p><p begin="02:07.103" end="02:09.897" itunes:key="L42">Flying free and taking on the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由翱翔 征服世界</span></p><p begin="02:09.907" end="02:12.547" itunes:key="L43">Curious to see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满怀好奇去探寻</span></p><p begin="02:12.557" end="02:14.680" itunes:key="L44">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="02:14.690" end="02:16.806" itunes:key="L45">Three, two, one, let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="02:17.821" end="02:19.601" itunes:key="L46">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="02:23.022" end="02:25.278" itunes:key="L47">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="02:27.191" end="02:32.617" itunes:key="L48">Everyone wants their fun, it's hard to trust somebody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人人都渴望快乐时光</span></p><p begin="02:32.627" end="02:37.200" itunes:key="L49">But somehow when I'm with you I feel at ease<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但与你相处时我却莫名安心</span></p><p begin="02:37.210" end="02:40.515" itunes:key="L50">You're so funny when I tease you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安心</span></p><p begin="02:40.525" end="02:42.941" itunes:key="L51">But I won't let them see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不会让他们看见</span></p><p begin="02:42.951" end="02:48.729" itunes:key="L52">Nobody else allowed but me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除我之外 谁都不准靠近</span></p><p begin="02:48.739" end="02:51.197" itunes:key="L53">Yeah</p><p begin="03:18.472" end="03:21.127" itunes:key="L54">Day by day I laugh a little more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日复一日 我笑得更加灿烂</span></p><p begin="03:21.137" end="03:23.794" itunes:key="L55">Cause my world is brighter than before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我的世界比从前明亮</span></p><p begin="03:23.804" end="03:26.604" itunes:key="L56">And it's thanks to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这都要感谢你</span></p><p begin="03:26.614" end="03:28.537" itunes:key="L57">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="03:28.547" end="03:29.290" itunes:key="L58">Let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="03:29.100" end="03:32.235" itunes:key="L59">Here we go, we go, we gotta go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发吧</span></p><p begin="03:32.245" end="03:34.797" itunes:key="L60">'Cause I know, I know that miracles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我深知奇迹终会降临</span></p><p begin="03:34.807" end="03:37.572" itunes:key="L61">Really do come true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美梦定能成真</span></p><p begin="03:37.582" end="03:39.656" itunes:key="L62">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="03:39.666" end="03:40.292" itunes:key="L63">Let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="03:40.302" end="03:43.023" itunes:key="L64">You and me, a team, how brilliant!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们出发吧</span></p><p begin="03:43.033" end="03:45.786" itunes:key="L65">Now you'll see how sweet I really am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在你将见识我真正的甜蜜</span></p><p begin="03:45.796" end="03:48.509" itunes:key="L66">Don't you fall for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可别为我神魂颠倒</span></p><p begin="03:48.519" end="03:50.607" itunes:key="L67">Hey now baby! (Hey!) Baby! (Hey!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的现在</span></p><p begin="03:50.617" end="03:52.791" itunes:key="L68">Three, two, one, let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿亲爱的听我说</span></p><p begin="03:53.635" end="03:55.375" itunes:key="L69">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p><p begin="03:59.104" end="04:02.089" itunes:key="L70">Hey hey hey hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿嘿嘿嘿！</span></p></div></body></tt>